{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53365","headline":"居士见僧讲金刚经至无我无人居士问云既无我无人是谁讲谁听座主无语乃与颂曰 · 庞藴","name":"居士见僧讲金刚经至无我无人居士问云既无我无人是谁讲谁听座主无语乃与颂曰","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"无我复无人，作麽有疎亲。\n劝师（《景德传灯录》卷八作「君」）休历坐，不是（《景德传灯录》作「似」）直求真。\n金刚般若性，外绝一纤尘。\n我闻并信受，总是假名陈。\n（同前书卷上）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53365.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53365","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}